 ('How should you explain the Sales Performance Analytics portfolio project truthfully?','Describe it as a portfolio project using synthetic sample data, and explain the Display → Diagnose → Decide workflow.','The repository README states that bundled metrics were calculated from a small synthetic sample; they are not real employer/client results. It also distinguishes retained-line sales from merchandise sales and postage.','Explain what each dashboard stage helps a sales operations manager see, investigate and decide.','Do not present synthetic sample values as commercial performance or employer impact.','Why is postage separated from merchandise sales in that project?','Intermediate','project-deep-dive',''),
